{"title":"The Keening Widow","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Keening Widow is a named <a href=\"#/monster/banshee\">Banshee</a> seen at level 30.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Keening Widow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Haunted Cavern</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 4×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-114\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-keening-widow\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bodkin-bolt\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7a2e1626588f08ce161d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bodkin Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"plume-arms\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/6e1ab5b23daa90d13e74.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Plume Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"plume-torso\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/5b91a6e4f4b629fa7a82.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Plume Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/c7ffc5d0340d5f1bcdfd.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Keening Widow</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/banshee\">Banshee</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>30</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>354</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>6 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}